      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "stageId": "G04A",
        "role": "field",
        "field": "acceptance"
      },
      "text": "SDK 10ms flush 实测约405ms，不能作总截止证明。隔离原型正常／积压自然排空\n；堵塞约361ms 强制收尾且资源退出。forced／dropped／unconfirmed 分开；实验\n清理不算 SDK 有界通过。",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SDK 10ms flush 实测约405ms，不能作总截止证明。隔离原型正常／积压自然排空\n；堵塞约361ms 强制收尾且资源退出。forced／dropped／unconfirmed 分开；实验\n清理不算 SDK 有界通过。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
